{"projectId":"p1","c":3}

---
SELECT count(), sum(score), avg(score), max(score), min(id), groupArray(id) FROM events WHERE 0
{"count()":0,"sum(score)":0,"avg(score)":null,"max(score)":0,"min(id)":"","groupArray(id)":[]}

---
