SELECT JSONExtractString('{"a":{"b":"x"}}', 'a', 'b'), JSONExtractInt('{"n":7}', 'n'), JSONHas('{"n":7}', 'n'), JSONExtractRaw('{"a":[1,2]}', 'a'), JSONExtractKeys('{"a":1,"b":2}')
{"JSONExtractString('{\\"a\\":{\\"b\\":\\"x\\"}}', 'a', 'b')":"x","JSONExtractInt('{\\"n\\":7}', 'n')":7,"JSONHas('{\\"n\\":7}', 'n')":1,"JSONExtractRaw('{\\"a\\":[1,2]}', 'a')":"[1,2]","JSONExtractKeys('{\\"a\\":1,\\"b\\":2}')":["a","b"]}
"
